{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"8599b7763963d7f6cf470cb70d2655909d3e69fdfc58e82c3bc2246f0142ece5","digest":{"component_or_area":"reconciler read/check paths","key_entities":["src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/runtime.py","src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_backend_registry.py","ReconcilerSettings","GitRuntime","BridgeRuntime","reconcile-check","Jira Cloud","Jira Data Center","SecretStr","SecretBytes"],"problem_keywords":["reconciler","read paths","ambient configuration","runtime isolation","immutable settings","backend construction","Jira integration","configuration authority"],"propositions":["Reconciler read and check paths call load_config() and inspect ambient environment/cwd, allowing runtime configuration changes to alter read scope or discard supplied registry config during operation execution","Reconciler must construct exactly one immutable backend projection from focused ReconcilerSettings, GitRuntime, and BridgeRuntime bindings, with stable project/query scope, TLS, timeouts, and auth for the operation lifetime","Custom tracker directory, branch, and remote must determine every read/ref/query owner; environment mutations after backend composition cannot alter an in-flight operation","Missing or conflicting auth, empty project/query scope, or malformed config must fail closed before any Jira model request or local write, with no anonymous or cross-provider fallback","Static auth carriers (SecretStr/SecretBytes) must remain absent from backend repr, equality, hash, cache, fingerprint, logs, and diagnostic boundaries, unwrapping only in the selected Jira sending adapter","Existing reconcile-check/dry-run provider-neutral outputs and Jira client/ACLI TLS/timeout/retry behavior must remain unchanged except for approved explicit-input, fail-fast, and stable-property deltas"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787490751707643001,"uuid":"d3956c5c-c0f4-4ca4-83a7-7defb949af20"}